00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:46.220
I-I guess so.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.510
Man, I'm not <i>helping</i> Masami—I'm <i>harming</i> her!

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:54.980
Oh, save us, Maccha Green!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:02.190
Fine. Don't surrender if you don't want to.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.030
Fight me instead.

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.830
A headache. A stomachache.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.910
Family commitments. A slipped disk...

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.950
And then a papier-mâché robot!

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:15.080
You've had one excuse after another to avoid fighting me, but that ends now.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.630
You're not getting out of it today, Utoku Masami!

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:23.090
Or should I say, Maccha Green!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.630
Huh?

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.930
What?!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.600
N-No, that's...

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:34.850
Give it up.
N-No, that's...

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:40.020
I, Otonashi Yukari, confirmed yesterday at Mount Hachikoku that you were the one inside.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.900
I figured that out ages ago.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:42.940
Yeah, I knew too.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:43.650
Same.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.190
Who <i>didn't</i>?

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:46.070
Right?

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:46.940
I didn't really want to mention it.

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:47.650
People can wear what they want.
I didn't really want to mention it.

