00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.950
I'm not Maccha Green!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.620
That's why I can't fight.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.750
What?!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.460
Oh?

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:08.670
