00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.220
with those stylish fake glasses of yours.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.350
<i>Is Masami really Maccha Green?</i>

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:22.350
<i>Their names </i>are<i> kind of similar...</i>

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.360
Nan man dabu, nan man dabu...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.740
<i>What now? I have to save everyone!</i>

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.490
<i>But...</i>

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.200
<i>Why won't she just admit it already?</i>

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:42.170
<i>Sure, even I have secrets I'd rather take to the grave,</i>

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.500
<i>but I'd rather give them up than send my </i>entire squad<i> to their graves.</i>

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.130
If she's just an ordinary person,

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:51.380
then that suit really <i>is</i> a super-powered exoskeleton.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:54.640
It'll be the star of my collection, Otonashi!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.290
<i>Exoskeleton?</i>

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.520
<i>Come on, it's clearly just a skintight bodysuit.</i>

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.730
<i>What is this, Power Rangers?</i>

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:09.490
<i>She wants to play Power Rangers like a little boy! Oh, my heart!</i>

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.660
People call this the roller coaster to hell!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:17.700
If you want it to stop, you must decide quickly, Utoku Masami!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.330
It's too late!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.540
Goodbye!
It's too late!

